              <li>That belongs to another person and to which the User does not have any right to</li>
              <li>That is grossly harmful, harassing, blasphemous, defamatory, obscene, pornographic, paedophilic, libellous, invasive of another's privacy, threatening, abusive or hateful or racially, ethnically objectionable, disparaging, or otherwise unlawful in any manner whatsoever</li>
