            You understand that the Platforms and software embodied within the Platforms may include security components that permit digital materials to be protected, and that use of these materials is subject to usage rules set by the Company. You may not attempt to reverse engineer, override, disable, circumvent or otherwise interfere with any such security components and usage rules embedded into the Platforms.
